    {"number":24,"title":"Port 36 functions Lombyte has matched (exact, +16 KB)","author":"Lynder063","draft":false,"head":"lombyte-ahead-ports","events":["opened","merged"],"mergedBy":"Lynder063","additions":1845,"deletions":1979,"changedFiles":53,"body":"What\nLombyte (the matching decomp of the US build, MIT) has matched 245 functions we had not (121,756 bytes by its last published report). This PR ports the ones that carry over to PAL: 36 functions, 16,056 bytes, each an exact match (2798 -> 2834 matched functions, matched code 19.80 % -> 20.24 %). Each port is its own commit and credits the Lombyte source file in a comment, as the earlier Lombyte ports do.\nHow\n\ntools/lombyte.py map/todo lists what Lombyte has and we don't. Pairs whose size…"},
